# A concise description of what this element means (e.g. for use in autogenerated summaries).
#: StructureDefinition.element.Group.type/short
msgid "Identifies the broad classification of the kind of resources the group includes: person | animal | practitioner | device | careteam | healthcareservice | location | organization | relatedperson | specimen"
msgstr "Определяет общую классификацию вида ресурсов, входящих в группу: person | animal | practitioner | device | careteam | healthcareservice | location | organization | relatedperson | specimen"

# A concise description of what this element means (e.g. for use in autogenerated summaries).
#: StructureDefinition.element.Group.membership/short
msgid "Basis for membership: definitional (defined by characteristics) or enumerated (defined by listed members)"
msgstr "Основа членства: определяющая (задаётся характеристиками) или перечислительная (задаётся списком участников)"

# A concise description of what this element means (e.g. for use in autogenerated summaries).
#: StructureDefinition.element.Group.code/short
msgid "Purpose or kind of the group, for example a screening, vaccination or donation target group"
msgstr "Назначение или вид группы, например целевая группа скрининга, вакцинации или донации"

# A concise description of what this element means (e.g. for use in autogenerated summaries).
#: StructureDefinition.element.Group.characteristic/short
msgid "Include or exclude members of the group by a shared trait"
msgstr "Включение или исключение участников группы по общему признаку"

# A concise description of what this element means (e.g. for use in autogenerated summaries).
#: StructureDefinition.element.Group.characteristic.code/short
msgid "Kind of characteristic used to define membership"
msgstr "Вид характеристики, используемой для определения членства"

# A concise description of what this element means (e.g. for use in autogenerated summaries).
#: StructureDefinition.element.Group.characteristic.value[x]/short
msgid "Value held by the characteristic. For diagnosis-based characteristics, ICD-10 codes are recommended"
msgstr "Значение, содержащееся в характеристике. Для характеристик на основе диагноза рекомендуются коды МКБ-10"
